WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.992
Unit twenty-three. Snakebite First Aid!

2
00:00:04.965 --> 00:00:09.254
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:09.304 --> 00:00:12.604
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.654 --> 00:00:16.782
Today we learn about Snakebite First Aid. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.554 --> 00:00:21.471
Snakebite. Say it with me. Snakebite!

6
00:00:24.978 --> 00:00:28.761
Stay calm. Say it with me. Stay calm!

7
00:00:32.247 --> 00:00:36.047
Keep still. Say it with me. Keep still!

8
00:00:39.546 --> 00:00:43.263
Hospital. Say it with me. Hospital!

9
00:00:46.771 --> 00:00:50.088
Bandage. Say it with me. Bandage!

10
00:00:53.571 --> 00:00:57.338
Do not cut. Say it with me. Do not cut!

11
00:01:00.838 --> 00:01:04.871
Remove rings. Say it with me. Remove rings!

12
00:01:08.371 --> 00:01:12.471
Emergency. Say it with me. Emergency!

13
00:01:15.998 --> 00:01:26.576
After a snakebite, stay calm and keep still to slow the venom. Remove rings or tight things, and go to hospital quickly. Do not cut, suck, or put ice on the bite.

14
00:01:26.626 --> 00:01:27.954
I can do that too!

15
00:01:29.221 --> 00:01:34.313
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:34.363 --> 00:01:35.513
Keep still!

17
00:01:36.609 --> 00:01:41.849
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:41.899 --> 00:01:43.232
Remove rings!

19
00:01:44.408 --> 00:01:50.651
Did you know? Hospitals can give antivenom, which is the real treatment for dangerous snakebites!

20
00:01:50.701 --> 00:01:52.567
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:53.260 --> 00:02:01.548
Think and answer. Why should a person bitten by a snake keep still?

22
00:02:01.598 --> 00:02:02.748
Great answer!

23
00:02:03.886 --> 00:02:08.736
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:08.786 --> 00:02:11.545
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

